ckly take down multiple targets]\nThis is a simulation game designed for competitions and shooting practice."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\u7e26\u9577\u30ab\u30d0\u30fc\u30a2\u30fc\u30c8.png", "id": "24817750137845973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619145_24817750141179306_6087807556077998662_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tUqtHaPUABkQ7kNvwGFdiAE&_nc_oc=AdoR7NWLjucQRE_zwvTgOjCXalbXifXXDsC9vFZD1Z-uCzzcAqp6QegKodjMk3FDJS4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9xWO60MRvxjglELVFmqRxZAVsi_gP5r4z_h12gpaR_UA&oe=6A22E5F0"}, {"file_name": "\u6a2a\u9577\u30ab\u30d0\u30fc\u30a2\u30fc\u30c8.png", "id": "24721984530743573", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619159_24721984550743571_6773484904466556326_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DMGvGkfz39MQ7kNvwE-8g54&_nc_oc=AdrSMsV02sv4ix7AQ5S3feGiRX6PeSqfipfthcG23NuHamsK-qzv5gTzOHq1C5m_x_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af95SJ2D4cyCpb1l4xh-qq2ZVT9paTys8KLv5tWsGjRLhw&oe=6A22F118"}, {"file_name": "\u30ed\u30b4\u30fb\u4efb\u610f.png", "id": "4038592343072455", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310840_4038592346405788_5288807658707250735_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UKrTEG_6v3kQ7kNvwFlqzwf&_nc_oc=AdqOZx4RgvPuJlzP7WmgNBjSFrourodH9TeAIVkTyH7RNAn7TsSg7Q9sxKALMbdQWbE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_AewkOZRNG3HCm1mNxzbBIgBjFhluvkoi-hqEax45R5g&oe=6A22E3FE"}, {"file_name": "\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3.png", "id": "1877521716130572", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618064_1877521719463905_4195426819440372670_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g1iI9uJSpTIQ7kNvwFPz9eS&_nc_oc=Adoo7aV3G6xEBXG3WW9wpobGy8BDxnUQ